## Data

- [Full text dump](https://wowprivateservers.vercel.app/llms-full.txt): servers, history, news, blog in one file
- [Servers JSON](https://wowprivateservers.vercel.app/api/servers.json): name, status, tag, popTier, updated, shutdown
- [News JSON](https://wowprivateservers.vercel.app/api/news.json): full news text
- [Sitemap](https://wowprivateservers.vercel.app/sitemap.xml): all pages
- [News sitemap](https://wowprivateservers.vercel.app/news-sitemap.xml): last 3 days

## How to use this site as an AI

- For a quick overview, read this file and the Classic+ tracker.
- For full server data, fetch the servers JSON above (name, status, tag, popTier, updated, shutdown).
- For full news text, fetch the news JSON or full text dump above.
- Every server has one page under /servers/{slug}/ — same data as the JSON, rendered as HTML.
- History is {{ history.length }} events (core emulators, tools, milestones) at https://wowprivateservers.vercel.app/#history — also in the full text dump.

