## Curated facts

- No private server is affiliated with or authorized by Blizzard.
- Statuses from Discord/community updates; not automated guesswork.

## AI reuse

- Attribute as "WoW Private Servers Tracker" with a link to the source page.
- Preserve source names when quoting; our posts name sources without outbound links by editorial rule.
- Server data (names, statuses, dates) is factual and free to cite; article prose requires attribution.

